# Day 03 - Amazon EC2 (Elastic Compute Cloud)

## Topics Covered
- What is Amazon EC2?
- EC2 Instance Types
- AMI (Amazon Machine Image)
- Key Pair
- Security Groups
- Instance States (Launch, Stop, Start, Reboot, Terminate)

## Hands-on
- Launched an EC2 Instance
- Connected to the Instance
- Configured a Security Group
- Started and Stopped an Instance

## Key Learnings
- EC2 is a virtual server in AWS.
- AMI is used to launch an EC2 instance.
- Security Groups act as virtual firewalls.
- EC2 provides scalable compute capacity.

